{"content":[{"c":["AMARIAH"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["Common OT name, meaning “the Lord has spoken” or “the Lord has promised.”"],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"},{"c":[" 1. Son of Meraioth in the line of Aaron’s son Eleazer (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.6.7,52","r":"1Chr.6.7,52","rawR":"1Chr.6.7,52","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.6.7,52","value":"1Chr.6.7,52"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 6:7, 52"},")."],"sourceClass":"list-space","t":"p"},{"c":[" 2. High priest, Azariah’s son and Ahitub’s father (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.6.11","r":"1Chr.6.11","rawR":"1Chr.6.11","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.6.11","value":"1Chr.6.11"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 6:11"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Ezra.7.3","r":"Ezra.7.3","rawR":"Ezra.7.3","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ezra.7.3","value":"Ezra.7.3"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ezr 7:3"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":[" 3. Hebron’s second son and Kohath’s grandson from Levi’s tribe (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.23.19","r":"1Chr.23.19","rawR":"1Chr.23.19","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.23.19","value":"1Chr.23.19"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 23:19"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.24.23","r":"1Chr.24.23","rawR":"1Chr.24.23","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.24.23","value":"1Chr.24.23"}],"t":"ref","v":"24:23"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":[" 4. Chief priest during the reign of Jehoshaphat of the southern kingdom of Judah (",{"href":"?bref=2Chr.19.11","r":"2Chr.19.11","rawR":"2Chr.19.11","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Chr.19.11","value":"2Chr.19.11"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Chr 19:11"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":[" 5. Levite who served faithfully under King Hezekiah of Judah (",{"href":"?bref=2Chr.31.14-15","r":"2Chr.31.14-15","rawR":"2Chr.31.14-15","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Chr.31.14-15","value":"2Chr.31.14-15"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Chr 31:14-15"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":[" 6. One of Binnui’s sons, who obeyed Ezra’s exhortation to divorce his pagan wife after the exile (",{"href":"?bref=Ezra.10.42","r":"Ezra.10.42","rawR":"Ezra.10.42","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ezra.10.42","value":"Ezra.10.42"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ezr 10:42"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":[" 7. Priest who returned from Babylon with Zerubbabel (",{"href":"?bref=Neh.12.2,13","r":"Neh.12.2,13","rawR":"Neh.12.2,13","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.12.2,13","value":"Neh.12.2,13"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 12:2, 13"},") and who, with Nehemiah and others, signed Ezra’s covenant of faithfulness to God after the exile (",{"href":"?bref=Neh.10.3","r":"Neh.10.3","rawR":"Neh.10.3","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.10.3","value":"Neh.10.3"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 10:3"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":[" 8. Shephatiah’s son, a descendant of Judah and ancestor of Athaiah. Amariah lived in Jerusalem after the exile (",{"href":"?bref=Neh.11.4","r":"Neh.11.4","rawR":"Neh.11.4","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.11.4","value":"Neh.11.4"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 11:4"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":[" 9. Hezekiah’s son and ancestor of the prophet Zephaniah (",{"href":"?bref=Zeph.1.1","r":"Zeph.1.1","rawR":"Zeph.1.1","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Zeph.1.1","value":"Zeph.1.1"}],"t":"ref","v":"Zep 1:1"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["10. Person mentioned in the Ezra genealogies of ",{"href":"?bref=1Esd.8.2","r":"1Esd.8.2","rawR":"1Esd.8.2","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Esd.8.2","value":"1Esd.8.2"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Esdras 8:2"}," and ",{"href":"?bref=2Esd.1.2","r":"2Esd.1.2","rawR":"2Esd.1.2","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Esd.1.2","value":"2Esd.1.2"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Esdras 1:2"},". In the first list he is Uzzi’s son and Ahitub’s father. In the second he is Azariah’s son and Eli’s father. He may be the same as Amariah #1 or #2 above, since both sources list him as Ahitub’s father."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Amariah","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"1 Chr 6:7, 52","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.6.7,52","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.6.7,52","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.6.7,52"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 6:11","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.6.11","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.6.11","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.6.11"},{"anchorText":"Ezr 7:3","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Ezra.7.3","rawQueryValue":"Ezra.7.3","sourceRefExact":"Ezra.7.3"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 23:19","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.23.19","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.23.19","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.23.19"},{"anchorText":"24:23","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.24.23","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.24.23","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.24.23"},{"anchorText":"2 Chr 19:11","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Chr.19.11","rawQueryValue":"2Chr.19.11","sourceRefExact":"2Chr.19.11"},{"anchorText":"2 Chr 31:14-15","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Chr.31.14-15","rawQueryValue":"2Chr.31.14-15","sourceRefExact":"2Chr.31.14-15"},{"anchorText":"Ezr 10:42","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Ezra.10.42","rawQueryValue":"Ezra.10.42","sourceRefExact":"Ezra.10.42"},{"anchorText":"Neh 12:2, 13","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Neh.12.2,13","rawQueryValue":"Neh.12.2,13","sourceRefExact":"Neh.12.2,13"},{"anchorText":"Neh 10:3","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Neh.10.3","rawQueryValue":"Neh.10.3","sourceRefExact":"Neh.10.3"},{"anchorText":"Neh 11:4","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Neh.11.4","rawQueryValue":"Neh.11.4","sourceRefExact":"Neh.11.4"},{"anchorText":"Zep 1:1","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Zeph.1.1","rawQueryValue":"Zeph.1.1","sourceRefExact":"Zeph.1.1"},{"anchorText":"1 Esdras 8:2","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Esd.8.2","rawQueryValue":"1Esd.8.2","sourceRefExact":"1Esd.8.2"},{"anchorText":"2 Esdras 1:2","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Esd.1.2","rawQueryValue":"2Esd.1.2","sourceRefExact":"2Esd.1.2"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"2113c115ef14d55ed77542a596dc6b0bab8af529a7ec6c5b50534d305ae33c6a","sourceItemName":"Amariah","sourceItemOrder":280,"sourceMember":"Articles/A.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Amariah","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Amariah","title":"Amariah","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}